# Contentlayer
.contentlayer

# Agent state (.omo/). Per operator decision, new files under .omo/ are ignored so
# `git status` stays readable. Note this does NOT untrack the ~900 .omo files that
# are already committed — git only skips untracked paths, so those keep showing up
# in `git status` when modified. Untrack them separately with
# `git rm -r --cached .omo` if the whole directory should leave the index.
.omo/

# CodeGraph tooling artifact (MCP server writes a relative-path SQLite index here)
/null/

# impeccable design-skill runtime state (caches, crops, captures)
.impeccable/

# pnpm writes this when `pnpm audit --ignore` is used, and reading it does NOT
# change audit results — the authoritative ignore list is the flag list in
# .forgejo/workflows/check.yml plus docs/security/audit-exceptions.md.
pnpm-workspace.yaml
